error code in ni_usb_init().

Fixes: 4e127de14fa7 ("staging: gpib: Add National Instruments USB GPIB driver")
Suggested-by: Greg KH <gregkh@linuxfoundation.org>
Suggested-by: Dave Penkler <dpenkler@gmail.com>
